 "sourceFacts": {
  "statements": [
   "Control passes: M433 GS Field_fe708077=3, Field_d94fe6ad=3; HDA list[3] hipStand 2.432 and hipMove 3.04, ZDA list[3] column 1 0.32 equal site spread.hipStand/hipMove/adsMove; 67 of 67 weapons equal (raw-checked, rawChecks in control and rows).",
   "HDA_Weapons: 18 rows x 7 f32 columns; ZDA_Moving_Weapons: 7 rows x 4 f32 columns; both files are byte-identical (sha256) to 1.4.3.0 and 1.4.3.5. All 154 cells and 201 GS selector words were read with frosty-raw-check and match the decode.",
   "All 67 weapons: HDA list row 1..5 (4:22, 3:18, 2:11, 1:10, 5:6), ZDA list row 3, Field_cee5ebfe 0. Every HDA row: H1 = 2.5 x hipStand, hipMove = 1.25 x hipStand. ZDA columns 1 to 3 equal in every row; column 4 ladder 1.67, 1.48, 1.3, 1.13, 0.97, 0.82, 0.68 (c4/c1 2.46 to 13.6).",
   "Site data/balance_tables.json HIP_SPREAD_TABLE equals HDA 18 x 7; MOVING_ACC_TIERS equals ZDA column 1. Field_bd300f62 does not occur in site data or sim.",
   "GS MinMaxDispersion Field_3ed1c995: array Field_a1ec29c4 of 18 slots (min Field_7baf4297, max Field_60e4e484); registry row names GS_*.MinMaxDispersion.<zoom>.<posture>.<Stationary|Moving|JumpingSprinting> map to slots by value across 80 owners. Standing.JumpingSprinting = slot 2 (unzoomed), slot 11 (zoomed). M433 raw-checked: slot 2 min 4.256 and max 12.0, slot 11 min 0.6 and max 12.0.",
   "Table H1 differs from the GS own JumpingSprinting leaf in 67 of 67 weapons (GS leaf = 1.75 x GS standing; table 2.5 x); ZDA column 4 differs from the GS zoomed leaf in 67 of 67 (GS 1.714 x or 2.0 x moving; table 3.53 x for M433).",
   "No registry row names HDA/ZDA fields (0 HDA/ZDA/DispersionHip/DispersionADS token rows in 34,340). No GS dispersion row has Jump, InAir, Slide or Airborne as a state; combined labels are JumpingSprinting and MovingJumpingSprinting.",
   "Listings search (L4057 listings-2110 298 files, L4057 listings-1435 302, 2026-10-10 1.4.3.5 listings 680): no listing contains both a motion token (jump, in-air, slide, sprint, airborne) and a dispersion/spread token. The 1.4.3.5 hipfire attribute delegate graph reads MinAngleIndex with an 18-entry ladder and a StandDispersionMinAngle input only."
  ],
