 "inference": [
  "The unnamed columns H1 (Field_160ef028) and ZDA column 4 (Field_bd300f62) are, by position, the Standing.JumpingSprinting entries of the hip (unzoomed) and ADS (zoomed) layouts. Evidence is column order parallel to GS slots plus equal values for the other six hip columns on M433 and hipStand on 49 of 67 weapons; no declared name.",
  "Jump and sprint share one source label; slide is not separately labelled. FIELD_MAP \"Jumping/sprinting ADS minimum\" for Field_bd300f62 holds at Probable, with the correction that the site holds H1, not bd300f62."
 ],
 "unresolved": [
  "Runtime consumer of HDA/ZDA rows is not exposed: no listing in the four searched folders contains both a jump/in-air/slide/sprint token and a dispersion/spread/min-angle token. Which soldier state selects the JumpingSprinting minimum, and whether slide uses it, is unresolved.",
  "The column names are positional: H1 and ZDA column 4 sit where GS MinMaxDispersion has Standing.JumpingSprinting. No descriptor or registry row names the table fields themselves (registry search for HDA/ZDA/DispersionHip/DispersionADS tokens: 0 rows), and the GS own JumpingSprinting leaf differs from the table column in 67 of 67 weapons (GS leaf = 1.75 x standing; table H1 = 2.5 x), so equality of values cannot pin the pairing.",
  "Which source wins at runtime for the JumpingSprinting minimum (GS own leaf 4.256 versus table H1 6.08 for M433) is not known; same open question for 0.6 versus 1.13 in ADS (and 0.35 versus 0.32 for ADS moving).",
  "Jump versus slide versus sprint cannot be separated from source: the label is one combined state JumpingSprinting.",
  "Composition with the max bound (GS JumpingSprinting max 12.0 for M433, raw-checked) and with per-shot bloom is not established.",
  "The 2.1.1.0 listing set on disk (L4057 listings-2110, 298 files) was still being produced by another lead at the time of reading; a 2.1.1.0 listing of the 1.4.3.5 hipfire attribute delegate (graph 481d2d6bc969c2f5) is absent, so its 2.1.1.0 body was not read."
 ],
 "siteImpact": "No site number changes. Site data/balance_tables.json HIP_SPREAD_TABLE already holds H1 as Field_160ef028 (18 of 18 rows x 7 columns equal the 2.1.1.0 HDA bytes); MOVING_ACC_TIERS holds only ZDA column 1 (7 of 7 equal). Field_bd300f62 is NOT in the site table: the brief premise that the site holds it unnamed is wrong; only the H1 column is held unnamed. Conditional: if a later in-game check shows jump/slide hip spread behaves as H1 (2.5x standing, M433 6.08 degrees), the site already has the column; ADS in-air would need ZDA column 4 added as a new table (M433 row 3 = 1.13 degrees). The simulator exposes standing/moving only, so nothing is applied now.",
